    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Police pull you over for expired tags. Hours later, they're scrolling through everything on your phone — with no warrant.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.827,
      "seconds": 6.827,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:e6f32d0bad1d6631070e9b9527e91d54d29e246d080c8417e5badec6eddc515d"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Your photos, your messages, your location history — more private than a search of your entire house, all sitting in your pocket.",
      "start": 7.547,
      "end": 14.745,
      "seconds": 7.198,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:78d72bd6b8f293fe8777b7815bc84bfc242eaa19e4f25bb82d10dded3bd558c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "After David Riley was arrested, a detective went through his phone and used what was on it to tie him to a shooting.",
      "start": 15.465,
      "end": 21.874,
      "seconds": 6.409,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:8187b41f44687203c6ac59651cbe92b521f12bc262cbddb5fe1ca9bf4eddf1be"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "In twenty-fourteen, the Supreme Court said no — unanimously. A phone is not just another pocket. Searching it needs a warrant.",
      "start": 22.594,
      "end": 29.792,
      "seconds": 7.198,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:aa57392205041994d8a1a6aa4c4f965311ec89ea228e9383547e4391b8c75795"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "Watch the full story on the channel. Follow for more.",
      "start": 30.512,
      "end": 33.298,
      "seconds": 2.786,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:1a22ec7a90c410eefd8646bc958ea7bafd9d1667a3901601cecc7e4fc050033d"
    }
  ]
}
